div.Section5{page:Section5;}</style></head><body style="tab-interval:21pt;" ><!--StartFragment--><div class="Section0" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >练习</font>3</span></b><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >一、</font>A1型题</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >(</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="楷体_GB2312" >单选题</font></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >)&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>
<span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'></span>
<div class="Section1" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >1.五行中&#8220;金&#8221;的特性是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A：炎上&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B：润下&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C：稼穑&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D：曲直&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E：从革&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >2.木的&#8220;所不胜&#8221;之&#8220;子&#8221;是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A：木&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B：水&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C：金&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D：火&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E：土&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >3.易于感冒，是气的什么功能减弱的表现：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.推动作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.温煦作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.防御作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.固摄作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.气化作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >4.血和津液的共同功能是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.滋润和濡养作用&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.&nbsp;作为神志活动的物质基础&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.&nbsp;调节机体的阴阳平衡&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.排泄代谢产物&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.以上都不是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >5.治疗出血证时用补气药物的机理是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.气能生血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.气能行血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.气能摄血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.血能载气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.血能养气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >6.人体生命活动的原动力是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.营气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.卫气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.元气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.宗气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.谷气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >7.五脏生理功能的特点是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.虚实交替，泻而不藏&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.藏精气而不泻，实而不能满&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.藏精气而不泻，满而不能实&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.传化物而不藏，满而不能实&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.传化物而不藏，实而不能满&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >8.与毛发的荣枯有关的是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.气与血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.精与液&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.津与气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.精与血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.精与气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >9.下列哪项不属于奇恒之腑&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.女子胞&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.脉&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.三焦&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.胆&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.脑&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >10.常导致局部冷痛得温则减，遇寒加重的邪气是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.暑邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.寒邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.燥邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.湿邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.火邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >11.怒伤&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.心&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.肝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.肺&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.脾&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.肾&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >12.方剂中必须具有的药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.君药&nbsp;B.臣药&nbsp;C.佐助药&nbsp;D.佐制药&nbsp;E.调和药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >13.小柴胡汤主治&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.少阳湿热证&nbsp;B.伤寒少阳证&nbsp;C.肝脾不和证&nbsp;D.腹痛腹泻&nbsp;E.上寒下热证&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >14.主治阳明气分热盛的代表方是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.白虎汤</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.竹叶石膏汤</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.白虎加人参汤</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.黄连解毒汤</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.清瘟败毒饮&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >15.表达药物对机体某部位选择性作用的性能是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.四性&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.五味&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.归经&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.毒性&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.毒性&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >16.沉降性具有的作用是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.潜阳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.升阳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.涌吐&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.发表&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.透疹&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >17.常单用，为治湿热泻痢的要药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.黄连&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.黄芩&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.石膏&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.龙胆&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.夏枯草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >18.与柴胡配伍，治疗少阳往来寒热证的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.黄芩&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.龙胆&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.黄连&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.黄芩&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.知母&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >19.能清热解毒，消散痈肿，治乳痈首选的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.金银花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.知母&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.板蓝根&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.蒲公英&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.大青叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >20.能清热解毒，消痈排脓，治肺痈首选的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.连翘&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.金银花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.鱼腥草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.大青叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.板蓝根&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >21.牡丹皮与赤芍除清热凉血外，还均有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.滋阴&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.泻火&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.活血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.解毒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.清肝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >22.大黄泻下通便的正确用法是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．生大黄后下&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．熟大黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．大黄先煎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．大黄炭&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．酒大黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >23.能软坚泻下的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．大黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．番泻叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．芒硝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．牵牛子&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．郁李仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >24.长于治下半身风湿痹痛的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.羌活&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.独活&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.川乌&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.蕲蛇&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.木瓜&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >25.广藿香除化湿外，还有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.安胎</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.解表</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.祛风湿</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.截疟</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.平喘&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >26.茯苓的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．利水、健脾、除痹&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．利水、安神、泄热&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．利水、健脾、安神&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．利水、清肺、明目&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．利水、凉血、清肺&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >27.能利湿退黄，为治湿热黄疸的要药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．滑石&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．泽泻&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．茵陈&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．车前子&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．茯苓&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >28.附子与肉桂均有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．回阳救逆，温经通脉&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．补火助阳，散寒止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．温经通脉，引火归元&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．温肺化饮，温中散寒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．散寒止痛，助阳止泻&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >29.能降逆止呕的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.干姜&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.吴茱萸&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.丁香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.附子&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.肉桂&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >30.能疏肝解郁，调经止痛的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．木香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．陈皮&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．枳实&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．香附&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．薤白&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >31.能通阳散结，行气宽中，为治胸痹之要药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．木香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．陈皮&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．厚朴&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．香附&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．薤白&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >32.具有活血化瘀功效的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.麦芽&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.神曲&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.山楂&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.莱菔子&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.陈皮&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >33.有收敛止血功效，善治肺胃损伤出血的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.艾叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.地榆&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.槐花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.蒲黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.白及&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >34.素有伤科要药之称的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.大蓟&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.艾叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.三七&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.侧柏叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.棕榈炭&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >35.性善&#8220;上行头目&#8221;，为治头痛的要药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.川芎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.羌活</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.延胡索&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.郁金&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.姜黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >36.能利胆退黄的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.川芎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.郁金&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.延胡索&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.牛膝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.桃仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >37.能引血下行的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.延胡索&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.郁金&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.牛膝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.红花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.川芎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >38.能活血祛瘀调经，为妇科经产要药的是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.牛膝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.桃仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.红花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.益母草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.莪术&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >39.半夏与天南星均有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.降逆止呕&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.祛风止痉&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.宣肺利咽&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.燥湿化痰&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.润肠通便&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >40.百部具有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.降气化痰&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.清胃止呕&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.杀虫灭虱&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.利水消肿&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.泻肺平喘&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >41.为醒神回苏要药的是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.麝香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.冰片&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.石菖蒲&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.远志&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.苏合香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >42.冰片除开窍醒神外，还有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.息风止痉&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.活血通经&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.化湿和胃&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.清热止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.祛寒止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >43.能大补元气的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.人参&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.党参&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.甘草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.黄芪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.白术&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >44.大剂量久服可导致水钠潴留，引起浮肿的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.黄芪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.白术&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.甘草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.山药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.西洋参&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >45.当归不具有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.补血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.活血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.调经&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.止血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.通便&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >46.五味子与乌梅均有的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.安蛔&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.温中&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.生津&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.行气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.解毒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >47.为治疥癣的要药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.常山&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.升药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.硼砂&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.炉甘石&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.硫黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >48.属于阴中之阳的时间是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.上午&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.前半夜&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.下午&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.后半夜&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.以上都不是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >49.在五行生克关系中，下列哪项是错误的：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.木克土&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.火生土&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.金生水&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.金克木&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.水克木</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >50.以调节气机升降为主要关系的两脏是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.肺与肾&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.肝与肺&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.心与肺&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.肾与肝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.心与肾</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >51.其性趋下的病邪为：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.火邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.燥邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.湿邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.风邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.以上都不是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >52.具有升散而又挟湿特性的邪气是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.湿邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.燥邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.热邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.暑邪&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.寒邪</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >53.治疗外感风寒表实无汗，兼咳喘者，首选的药物是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.白芷&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.麻黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.桂枝&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.紫苏&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.薄荷</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >54.能润肠通便，略兼补虚的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A大黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.芦荟&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.番泻叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.火麻仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.芒硝</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >55.阴亏血虚者应慎用的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.补阴药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.补血药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.平肝阳药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.清虚热药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.祛风湿药</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >56.陈皮的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.理气调中，燥湿化痰&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.疏肝破气，散结消滞&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.破气消积，化痰消痞&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.行气调中，止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.行气疏肝，破气散结</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >57.可与黄芪、升麻等补气升阳药配伍治疗脏器下垂证的药是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.枳实&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.青皮&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.香附&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.沉香&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.木香</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >58.被称为治疗水火烫伤之要药的是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.白茅根&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.小蓟&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.茜草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.三七&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.地榆</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >59.既可安神，又可祛痰开窍的药物是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．首乌藤&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．远志&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．酸枣仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．柏子仁&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．龙骨</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >60.针对主证主病发挥治疗作用的药称&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．君药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．使药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．臣药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．佐药&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．助药</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>
<span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'></span>
<div class="Section2" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >二、</font>B1型题</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >(配伍题。以下提供了若干组考题，每组题共用五个备选答案，备选答案后有两个以上的问题，每个问题要从备选答案中选择一个正确答案。每个备选答案可选一次以上，也可以一次也不选择。)&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>
<span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'></span>
<div class="Section3" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >61-62&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.绝对&nbsp;B.相对&nbsp;C.左右&nbsp;D,水火&nbsp;E.上下</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >61.阴阳的征兆是:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >62.事物阴阳的属性是:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >63-64&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.阴盛则内寒&nbsp;B.阳虚则外寒&nbsp;C.阴盛则阳病&nbsp;D.阳虚则阴盛内寒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.阴损及阳,阳损及阳</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >63.可以用阴阳互根解释的是:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >64.可以用阴阳转化解释的是:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >65-66&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.实热证&nbsp;B.虚寒证&nbsp;C.阴阳両虚证&nbsp;D.虚热证&nbsp;E.真寒假热证</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >65.阴阳互损可形成:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >66.阴盛格阳可形成:</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-