so-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.祛风散寒、胜湿、止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.发散风寒、止呕、止咳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.祛风解表、透疹、止血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >76.羌活的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >77.生姜的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >78-79&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.发汗、平喘、利水&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.发汗、温通、助阳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.祛风、胜湿、止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.发散、止呕、止咳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.祛风、透疹、止血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >78.麻黄的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >79.桂枝的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >80-83&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.发表透疹、解毒、升阳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.疏散风热、清头目、止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.发表退热、疏肝、升举&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.疏散风热、明目、解毒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.解肌退热、生津、透疹&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >80.升麻的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >81.菊花的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >82.柴胡的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >83.葛根的功效是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >84-85&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.香薷&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.羌活&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.防风&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.荆芥&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.细辛</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >84.既祛风解表，又止痉的药是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >85.既祛风解表，又止血的药是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >86-88&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.神曲&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.山楂&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.麦芽&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.谷芽&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.鸡内金</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >86.善消肉积的药物是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >87.善消米面淀粉类食积的药物是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >88.善治食积兼表证的药物是</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >89-90&nbsp;题共用备选答案：</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.寒者热之&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.热者寒之&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.阳病治阴&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.阴病治阳&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.滋阴扶阳</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >89.&#8220;益火之源，以消阴翳&#8221;指的是：</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >90.&#8220;壮水之主，以制阳光&#8221;指的是：</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>
<span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'></span>
<div class="Section4" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face="宋体" >三、</font>X型题</span></b><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:楷体_GB2312;mso-hansi-font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >(不定项选择题，每道题下面均有五个备选答案，其中至少有一个备选答案是正确的。多选或少选均不得分。)&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div>
<span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br clear=all style='page-break-before:auto;mso-break-type:section-break'></span>
<div class="Section5" ><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >91.下列属于金行的是：&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.爪、筋、皮、肉、口&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.鼻、皮、毛、收、悲&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.皮、鼻、口、胃、长&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.商、辛、白、哭、悲&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.秋、西、咳、燥、收&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >92.属五脏正确的在志有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.心在志为喜&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.肺在志为忧&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.肝在志为怒&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.脾在志为思&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.肾在志为恐&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >93.五加皮的功效有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.利水&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.清利湿热&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.强筋骨&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.祛风湿&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.安胎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >94.蒲黄的功效是&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.止血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.化瘀&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.收敛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.利尿&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.安胎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >95.有收敛止血功效的药物有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.白及&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.槐花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.蒲黄&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.艾叶&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.仙鹤草&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >96.既能化痰，又能止呕的药物有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A．半夏&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B．旋覆花&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C．竹茹&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D．桔梗</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E．瓜蒌&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >97.具有平肝潜阳，平喘功效的药物有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.石决明&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.牡蛎&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.磁石&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.赭石&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.龙骨&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >98.石菖蒲的功效有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.开窍&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.化湿&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.和胃&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.宁神&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.活血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >99.当归的功效有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.补血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.活血&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.调经&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.止痛&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.通便&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=p  style="mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >100.桂枝的功效有&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >A.助阳化气&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >B.温中止呕&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >C.温通经脉&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >D.发汗解肌&nbsp;</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" >E.平喘止咳</span><span style="mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>